  "the Gemfile (no gemspec, so referred to by root) and package.json (named docuseal) share the root folder; Rails and Sidekiq belong to the first, Vue, Turbo and webpack to the second",
  "config/database.yml is ERB: PostgreSQL by default, SQLite when DATABASE_URL is empty in production, MySQL through trilogy when DATABASE_URL starts with mysql",
  "Redis has no compose service: lib/puma/plugin/redis_server.rb forks a local redis-server and config/dotenv.rb writes REDIS_URL for Sidekiq",
  "S3, Google Cloud Storage and Azure Blob are alternative Active Storage services in config/storage.yml",
  "daisyUI is a Tailwind plugin and Shakapacker is the Rails wrapper around webpack: neither is listed apart",
  "eID Easy is reached only from the Vue signing form, and Rollbar only from a meta tag when ROLLBAR_CLIENT_TOKEN is set",
  "RSpec is in the development and test group, Capybara in test",
